WEBVTT

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.330
This is the place, huh?

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:17.900
Gaara is on the other side of this boulder.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.670
It looks like they put up a barrier.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:22.600
What's the plan?

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.400
Let's bust through!

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:25.300
No!

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.970
You're late, Kakashi.

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:32.830
Well, you see...

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:35.100
we got caught up in something
troublesome along the way.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:37.730
Naruto! Sakura!

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.100
Kakashi... By troublesome,
you certainly don't mean me, do you?

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:44.800
Hey!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:46.500
Naruto...

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:50.100
Now, shall we do this, Kakashi?

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.530
Yeah.

00:00:51.770 --> 00:00:54.430
FORBIDDEN

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.930
<i>Hang on, Gaara.</i>

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:34.970
<i>Charge Tactic!
Button Hook Entry!!

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:40.570
It looks like there's
a large cavern inside, but...

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.030
But...?

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:51.970
I can't really see clearly
what's going on inside...

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.170
It looks like there are
several people inside...

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.230
What about Gaara, Neji?

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.930
What's happening to Gaara?!

00:03:03.570 --> 00:03:04.470
Wait!

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:06.300
I'm searching right now!

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:16.900
Neji!

00:03:17.700 --> 00:03:18.570
Hey!

00:03:44.730 --> 00:03:48.400
Wh-What's...that...?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.730
What is it?
Hey! What's in there, Neji?!

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.430
Let go of me...

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.170
What was in there?

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.200
It's hard to explain in words...

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:05.530
Which means...

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:10.230
Which means we just have to
check it out directly for ourselves, right?

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:13.070
That makes things simple.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:45.330
A barrier, huh...?

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.430
<i>It's getting noisy outside.</i>

00:04:57.230 --> 00:05:00.970
<i>It appears they've arrived.</i>

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.300
Which group? Hm?

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.500
The group my man Kisame stalled?

00:05:09.900 --> 00:05:11.230
Or is it...

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:15.100
<i>It's...both groups...</i>

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.770
<i>So they arrived at the same time, huh?</i>

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:20.770
<i>However...</i>

00:05:27.330 --> 00:05:30.470
<i>They were just a bit late...</i>

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:36.400
It seems they've got another
Jinchuriki with them...

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:43.670
Don't take it personally, Itachi.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:54.630
What's the plan?

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:58.730
First, we have to
remove the barrier, Lee.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.430
How do we do that?

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:05.400
We need to figure out
what kind of barrier it is, right?

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:06.800
Yeah.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:10.800
All right. First, we need to find out
what type of barrier this is!

00:06:10.830 --> 00:06:12.000
Isn't that right, Kakashi!

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:12.900
Right.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:16.900
FORBIDDEN

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:18.830
What does it look like to you?

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.170
This is...a Five-Seal Barrier.

00:06:23.530 --> 00:06:24.500
I agree.

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.700
A Five-Seal Barrier?

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.730
A Five-Seal Barrier is created by placing...

00:06:32.770 --> 00:06:36.900
paper tags with "Forbidden" written
on them in five locations in the area.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.230
There's the Forbidden tag
here in front of us...

00:06:43.700 --> 00:06:45.570
and tags in four other locations...

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:47.400
How can we remove them?

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.400
We can't remove the barrier

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:53.670
unless we remove the tags in
all five locations simultaneously.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.200
It must be done simultaneously, huh?

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:58.730
That's right.

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:02.500
The barrier can't be removed unless
the five tags are removed simultaneously.

00:07:03.370 --> 00:07:04.500
That's how it's been set up.

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:07.700
That tag there...

00:07:09.870 --> 00:07:11.770
And there are four others...

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.500
FORBIDDEN

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.800
Then, where are the other four tags?!

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:24.600
Neji.

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:26.500
I know.

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:29.230
Byakugan!

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:44.730
I found them!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:47.030
Where are they, Neji?!

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:52.030
There's one on a boulder about
500 meters northeast of here...

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:55.800
The...second one...

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.200
is on the trunk of a tree growing
along a riverbank

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.330
350 meters to the south-southeast...

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:03.800
The third one...

00:08:04.770 --> 00:08:07.430
is on a cliff about
650 meters to the northwest...

00:08:09.100 --> 00:08:10.000
The last one...

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:13.830
is in a forest a little less than
800 meters to the southwest...

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:15.870
Those are the four locations.

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.400
If so, then they are pretty far away.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.800
What will the signal be?

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.600
No problem there!

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.630
At that distance...

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:29.000
we should be able to use
wireless radios.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:30.770
Wireless radios, huh?!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.170
I see.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:42.700
Okay, we'll all stay in communication
and find the tags with Neji's directions!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:50.170
<i>Now then. Shall we get going...?</i>

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:52.730
<i>It's starting to get noisy outside</i>

00:08:52.770 --> 00:08:55.800
<i>and we've got our mission
to complete, after all.</i>

00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:58.770
<i>Exactly...</i>

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.900
<i>What shall we do with
the guys outside?</i>

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:07.900
<i>Well, we don't even know
if they can get in here...</i>

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:10.430
<i>Don't underestimate them.</i>

00:09:12.970 --> 00:09:14.400
<i>You should know.</i>

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:22.500
<i>Well... I acknowledge
their brute strength, at least.</i>

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:27.670
<i>Sasori.</i>

00:09:29.530 --> 00:09:30.570
<i>Deidara.</i>

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.430
<i>You take care of the guys outside.</i>

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.300
I knew it would turn out like this...

00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:44.900
<i>But take the Jinchuriki alive.</i>

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.800
We know.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:50.430
<i>Everyone else is dismissed.</i>

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:54.430
<i>Let's go.</i>

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:56.170
<i>Right...</i>

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:02.100
<i>We'll be leaving, too...</i>

00:10:02.930 --> 00:10:04.200
Itachi...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:10.000
What's the Nine-Tailed Jinchuriki like?

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:20.100
<i>Tell him.</i>

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:31.600
<i>He'll be the first one to yell
and scream at you.</i>

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:35.630
What does that mean?

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:39.870
Doesn't he have any more
specific characteristics?

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.230
Oh my...

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:47.370
<i>Well, that's about it...</i>

00:11:04.170 --> 00:11:08.770
<i>You okay with that?
Wasn't he your  target?</i>

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.330
Let's go.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:14.800
Okay.

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.600
We'll remove the tags in
the four surrounding locations.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:35.970
If this is a competition of speed,
our team will probably be faster, after all.

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:40.270
We're counting on you!

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:44.000
All right, you head for
the northwest forest, Lee!

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.930
Yes, Guy Sensei!

00:11:46.830 --> 00:11:49.170
I leave the northeast boulder to you, Neji.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.330
Roger.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.270
And you take the south-southeast, Tenten.

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:55.670
Understood.

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:58.400
I'll head for the northwest cliff.

00:11:58.970 --> 00:12:02.830
I'm sure that one will be in
the location most difficult to remove.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:04.970
What's the frequency?

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.530
174.

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:08.300
Roger.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:14.270
<i>Can you hear me guys?</i>

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.870
Lee! You've got your microphone
turned up too high!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:25.700
Oh!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.070
<i>I'm sorry!</i>

00:12:31.130 --> 00:12:33.330
Lee... Lee...!

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:38.070
I'm sorry...

00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:46.070
My wireless radio settings are okay.

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:49.400
Mine are okay as well.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:52.530
All right. Team Guy...

00:12:58.670 --> 00:12:59.770
R-Right!

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.570
Okay, okay...

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.200
With the full power of youth!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:13:59.670
- Fight!
-Yeah!

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:01.170
- Fight!
- Yeah!

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.900
- Fight! Fight!
- Yeah! Yeah!

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:05.470
- And an extra fight!
- Yeah!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:07.030
Scatter!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:11.270
How cool. What cool enthusiasm!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.000
Hey guys, let's do that, too...!

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:14.400
I'd rather die...

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:15.800
Right...

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:17.130
You fool...!

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:22.070
Well, it's time for me to get going.

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:26.130
There's no reason for me to be here
if I'll just be in the way.

00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.230
Good work, Pakkun.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:30.930
Okay, I'm gone...

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.070
<i>I leave the rest to you.</i>

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.830
Right...

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.870
We got it...

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:52.830
<i>I'll be waiting to hear from you.</i>

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.130
Verifying operation.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:19.470
<i>The four members of Team Guy are
to stand by once they find their tags!</i>

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:22.170
<i>After all members have
reached their positions...</i>

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.100
<i>we'll remove the tags
all at once on my signal!</i>

00:15:24.470 --> 00:15:25.330
<i>Got it?!</i>

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:25.970
Yes!

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:29.730
<i>Of course, Team Kakashi will remove
their tags simultaneously as well.</i>

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:33.030
<i>With this, the Five-Seal Barrier
will be removed.</i>

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.570
The moment the barrier is removed...

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.630
Sakura will destroy the boulder
at the entrance.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:48.030
That will be our signal to break inside...
and recover Gaara.

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.630
<i>Gaara...</i>

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.670
They're late...

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:09.270
I wish they'd just hurry up
and get here...

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:17.930
What's wrong, my man Sasori?

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:22.600
I thought you didn't like
to be kept waiting.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:27.130
Yeah... I hate it...

00:16:30.330 --> 00:16:31.630
<i>Sasori...</i>

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:38.770
<i>I never thought...
a day like this would come...</i>

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:43.370
This is Neji. I'm in position.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.070
I've found mine, too!
I'll be arriving soon.

00:16:54.030 --> 00:16:55.170
I've got mine, too!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.370
<i>Neji!</i>

00:16:58.230 --> 00:16:59.230
I know!

00:17:00.530 --> 00:17:01.630
Byakugan!

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:10.230
A little further south!

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:14.630
A little further...
All right, it's right there!

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:17.270
Okay! I found it!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:21.130
<i>This is Lee! I'm in position!</i>

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:24.500
Kakashi, how's it going there?

00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:26.500
We're ready when you are.

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:33.200
We'll break in using
the Button Hook Entry.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:34.430
Right.

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.200
I know!

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:38.700
Yeah!

00:17:43.730 --> 00:17:48.070
All right, everyone!
Remove the tags on the count of three!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:49.600
<i>Here we go!</i>

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:53.270
<i>One...two...three!</i>

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.430
Sakura!

00:17:58.630 --> 00:17:59.400
Right!

00:18:18.230 --> 00:18:20.900
<i>All right, it looks like it went well...</i>

00:18:36.900 --> 00:18:38.970
Wh-What's that...?!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.400
<i>We're too late...</i>

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.400
<i>Sasori...</i>

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:38.830
Now...which one's the Jinchuriki?

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.500
You...creeps.

00:19:48.630 --> 00:19:50.500
I'll kill the both of you!

00:19:52.370 --> 00:19:56.600
<i>The first one to start yelling
and screaming...</i>

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.830
<i>It's him, huh?</i>

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:02.530
It looks like it.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:41.930
Now then, I'm going to take out
a scroll you can find anywhere.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:44.200
But when I count to three,
a huge Shuriken appears...

00:21:44.230 --> 00:21:46.270
Hey, don't be taking
someone else's skills!

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:48.870
Shut up! I'm practicing for
a talent show.

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:49.600
What did you say?!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:54.670
Hey, stop the stupid fighting.
I'll teach you my best skill.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:57.600
Look at these wonderful
midair Kunai Knives!

00:21:57.630 --> 00:21:59.400
Oh, the Kunai Knives are floating!

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:01.700
I'll teach you for just 300 ryo.

00:22:01.770 --> 00:22:04.430
Uh... I can't do it without
the Puppet Master technique anyway.

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:07.800
Next episode:
"Traps Activate! Team Guy's Enemies!"
